  "fullDescription": "Arome is a refined serif typeface designed to bring a sense of elegance, romance, and timeless beauty into your work. With its graceful curves, high contrast strokes, and delicate details, Arome creates a luxurious look that feels both classic and modern.\nThis typeface comes in Regular and Oblique styles, giving you the flexibility to create designs that feel polished, expressive, and full of character. Whether you’re going for something soft and feminine or bold and editorial, Arome adapts beautifully.\nWhat makes Arome stand out is its stylish ligatures and carefully crafted alternates, allowing you to create unique, high-end typography with ease. Every letter is designed to flow naturally, making your text look effortlessly elegant.\n\nPerfect for:\n– Luxury branding & logos\n– Wedding invitations\n– Fashion editorials & magazines\n– Beauty and lifestyle designs\n– Packaging design\n– Social media content\n– Headlines & display typography\n\nFeatures:\n– A – Z set (Uppercase & Lowercase)\n– Number\n– Punctuation\n– Alternates\n– Ligatures\n– Multilingual\n– Arome Characters Map\n\nFile type:\n– Arome Regular (OTF, TTF, WOFF)\n– Arome Oblique (OTF, TTF, WOFF)",
